{1}{Who are you to dare imprison me like this! Were you never taught to respect the dead?}{Who are you to dare imprison me like this! Were you never taught to respect the dead?}{}{}{}{lf1 1, gf3220 1}
{2}{A strange way to thank the one who freed you, spirit...}{}{5}{}{30}{}
{3}{Could I have made a mistake while performing the ritual?}{1}{5}{}{60}{}
{4}{Could I have made a mistake while performing the ritual?}{0}{5}{}{60}{}
{5}{You thank @pcname@ strange after me help you!}{}{-4}{}{30}{}
{6}{Me do ritual wrong?}{}{-4}{}{60}{}

{30}{Freed! Did I hear you correctly?! Spoken like a vile necromancer, no less!}{Freed! Did I hear you correctly?! Spoken like a vile necromancer, no less!}{}{}{}{}
{31}{A vile necromancer?}{}{1}{}{-5}{}
{32}{What do you accuse me of, spirit?}{}{5}{}{-5}{}
{33}{What you blame @pcname@ for?}{}{-4}{}{-5}{}

{60}{A mistake! In what way do you imagine you erred? On the contrary, you have achieved what the darkest necromancers have always desired!}{A mistake! In what way do you imagine you erred? On the contrary, you have achieved what the darkest necromancers have always desired!}{}{}{}{}
{61}{Dark necromancers?}{}{1}{}{-5}{}
{62}{What do you accuse me of, spirit?}{}{5}{}{-5}{}
{63}{What you blame @pcname@ for?}{}{-4}{}{-5}{}

{90}{[The spirit pauses, then resumes speaking with sudden surprise.] I do not recognize you. You are not the Master Weaver, and your thoughts are not his. So he deceived you just as he deceived me!... I too was convinced that the source of evil lurked within this tomb. It lies nowhere but within him...}{[The spirit pauses, then resumes speaking with sudden surprise.] I do not recognize you. You are not the Master Weaver, and your thoughts are not his. So he deceived you just as he deceived me!... I too was convinced that the source of evil lurked within this tomb. It lies nowhere but within him...}{}{}{}{re +30}
{91}{[Continue]}{}{1}{}{120}{}

{120}{The ritual of Spirit Separation, as he calls it, is nothing but a clever deception and a powerful spell that binds the souls of the dead to his own. In this way he draws closer to immortality. But now I can tell you that, should he ever lose them, he will suffer one death for every soul he has stolen...}{The ritual of Spirit Separation, as he calls it, is nothing but a clever deception and a powerful spell that binds the souls of the dead to his own. In this way he draws closer to immortality. But now I can tell you that, should he ever lose them, he will suffer one death for every soul he has stolen...}{}{}{}{}
{121}{I do not believe you!}{}{5}{}{150}{}
{122}{I trust you!}{}{5}{}{180}{}
{123}{Me not believe spirit!}{}{-4}{}{150}{}
{124}{Me trust you, spirit!}{}{-4}{}{180}{}

{150}{Why would I lie to you? Did the Master Weaver not give you a Sacred Stone to enter the tomb, but none with which to leave? He did the same to me, and he will do it to anyone who tries to solve the mystery! None of those who came before us ever found the tomb's exit. And for good reason: it does not exist...}{Why would I lie to you? Did the Master Weaver not give you a Sacred Stone to enter the tomb, but none with which to leave? He did the same to me, and he will do it to anyone who tries to solve the mystery! None of those who came before us ever found the tomb's exit. And for good reason: it does not exist...}{}{}{}{}
{151}{[Continue]}{}{1}{}{160}{}

{160}{The Death Lanterns are not trying to enter the tomb, as the Master Weaver claims. We care only about his life. If he dies, all the imprisoned souls will finally be freed...}{The Death Lanterns are not trying to enter the tomb, as the Master Weaver claims. We care only about his life. If he dies, all the imprisoned souls will finally be freed...}{}{}{}{}
{161}{You are lying!}{}{5}{}{0}{co}
{162}{I believe you now.}{}{5}{}{180}{}
{163}{You lie!}{}{-4}{}{0}{co}
{164}{@pcname@ believe you now.}{}{-4}{}{180}{}

{180}{The only means by which you can return to the surface lies with me. I will take you out of the tomb. In return, you will help the Death Lanterns regain their freedom.}{}{}{}{}{qu1275 4, qu1276 2}
{181}{So be it.}{}{5}{}{-2}{}
{182}{Agreed.}{}{-4}{}{-2}{}

{210}{[The spirit pauses, then resumes speaking with sudden surprise.] I do not recognize you. You are not the Master Weaver, and your thoughts are not his. So he deceived you just as he deceived me!... I too was convinced that the source of evil lurked within this tomb. It lies nowhere but within him...}{[The spirit pauses, then resumes speaking with sudden surprise.] I do not recognize you. You are not the Master Weaver, and your thoughts are not his. So he deceived you just as he deceived me!... I too was convinced that the source of evil lurked within this tomb. It lies nowhere but within him...}{}{}{}{re +30}
{211}{[Continue]}{}{1}{}{240}{}

{240}{But I sense that you too know the secrets of evil necromancy. If you sacrifice the knowledge you might have used to learn new spells in that dark college of magick, I will trust you.}{But I sense that you too know the secrets of evil necromancy. If you sacrifice the knowledge you might have used to learn new spells in that dark college of magick, I will trust you.}{}{}{}{}
{241}{Very well.}{}{1}{}{-7}{}

{260}{Are you prepared to make the sacrifice I ask of you?}{Are you prepared to make the sacrifice I ask of you?}{}{}{}{}
{261}{Yes.}{}{1}{}{-10}{}
{262}{No.}{}{1}{}{0}{fl 300}

